msgid "Moves WordPress media files to the Hosting Ukraine storage and back, with verification, and serves them from the storage either under their original addresses (transparent proxy) or directly."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-simple-storage-github-updater.php:103
msgid "Version 0.3.5: media that do not fit on the hosting can be uploaded to the storage by hand; a new button compares them with the Media Library and connects them. Version 0.3.4: fixes after an audit. A file in the storage can no longer be overwritten by a new upload or by a local file of the same size, and a transfer back keeps serving while a name conflict is open. Code and data files stay out of the public storage, and the transparent proxy decides file types itself. A \"Check serving\" button replaces saving the settings. Version 0.3.3: new files go to the storage and leave the disk at the end of the request that wrote them."
msgstr ""

